<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#05081c">
    
    <!-- DYNAMIC SEO GOLD STANDARD -->
    <title><%= typeof seo !== 'undefined' ? seo.title : 'Investasi Digital Transparan | Dents Web' %></title>
    <meta name="description" content="<%= typeof seo !== 'undefined' ? seo.desc : 'Skema harga transparan tanpa biaya siluman. Solusi website performa tinggi yang siap scale bisnis lu dari hari pertama.' %>">
    <meta name="keywords" content="<%= typeof seo !== 'undefined' ? seo.keywords : 'harga pembuatan website, biaya web developer, paket aplikasi mobile, harga website profesional' %>">
    <link rel="canonical" href="<%= typeof seo !== 'undefined' ? seo.url : 'https://dentsweb.my.id/pricing' %>">
    
    <!-- Google Site Verification -->
    <% if (typeof settings !== 'undefined' && settings.googleVerification) { %>
    <meta name="google-site-verification" content="<%= settings.googleVerification %>" />
    <% } %>
    
    <!-- Open Graph / Facebook -->
    <meta property="og:type" content="article">
    <meta property="og:url" content="<%= typeof seo !== 'undefined' ? seo.url : 'https://dentsweb.my.id/pricing' %>">
    <meta property="og:title" content="<%= typeof seo !== 'undefined' ? seo.title : 'Investasi Digital Transparan | Dents Web' %>">
    <meta property="og:description" content="<%= typeof seo !== 'undefined' ? seo.desc : '' %>">
    <meta property="og:image" content="<%= typeof seo !== 'undefined' ? seo.image : '/public/img/axalogo.png' %>">
    
    <!-- Twitter Cards -->
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
    <meta name="twitter:url" content="<%= typeof seo !== 'undefined' ? seo.url : 'https://dentsweb.my.id/pricing' %>">
    <meta name="twitter:title" content="<%= typeof seo !== 'undefined' ? seo.title : 'Investasi Digital Transparan | Dents Web' %>">
    <meta name="twitter:description" content="<%= typeof seo !== 'undefined' ? seo.desc : '' %>">
    <meta name="twitter:image" content="<%= typeof seo !== 'undefined' ? seo.image : '/public/img/axalogo.png' %>">

    <!-- Schema.org JSON-LD -->
    <% if (typeof seo !== 'undefined' && seo.schemaString) { %>
    <script type="application/ld+json">
        <%- seo.schemaString %>
    </script>
    <% } %>
    
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="<%= typeof settings !== 'undefined' && settings.favicon ? settings.favicon : '/public/img/axalogo.png' %>">
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="<%= typeof settings !== 'undefined' && settings.logo ? settings.logo : '/public/img/axalogo.png' %>">
    
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Lexend+Deca:wght@500;600;700;800&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@1,400;1,500;1,600;1,700&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/public/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
    
    <%- include('partials/header') %>

    <main>
        <!-- Pricing Hero -->
        <section class="section-hero" style="min-height: 50vh; padding-top: 150px; padding-bottom: 70px;">
            <div class="orb-glow-blue" style="top: -10%; left: -5%;"></div>
            <div class="orb-glow-lime" style="bottom: -15%; right: 5%; opacity: 0.1;"></div>

            <div class="container text-center" style="position: relative; z-index: 2; max-width: 820px;">
                <div class="badge-tag-lime" style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
                    <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"></polygon></svg>
                    PRICING JELAS &bull; NO HIDDEN COST
                </div>
                <h1 style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
                    Investasi Cerdas, <span class="font-editorial text-lime">Hasil Maksimal</span>
                </h1>
                <p style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.76); line-height: 1.75;">
                    Nggak ada biaya siluman di belakang layar. Pilih tier yang pas buat fase bisnis lu sekarang, upgrade kapan pun lu butuh scale lebih masif.
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Pricing Cards Section -->
        <section class="section-white" style="padding-top: 70px; padding-bottom: 90px;">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="grid-3" style="align-items: stretch;">
                    <% if (typeof pricing !== 'undefined' && pricing.length > 0) { %>
                        <% pricing.forEach(pkg => { %>
                            <div class="pricing-card-kalana <%= pkg.isFeatured ? 'featured' : '' %>">
                                <% if (pkg.isFeatured) { %>
                                    <div class="pricing-badge-popular">
                                        <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l2.4 7.4h7.6l-6.2 4.5 2.4 7.4-6.2-4.6-6.2 4.6 2.4-7.4-6.2-4.5h7.6z"/></svg>
                                        PILIHAN FAVORIT
                                    </div>
                                <% } %>

                                <h3 style="color: var(--navy-text); font-size: 1.35rem; margin-bottom: 8px;"><%= pkg.name %></h3>
                                <p style="font-size: 0.925rem; color: var(--slate-body); min-height: 48px; line-height: 1.6;"><%= pkg.description %></p>
                                
                                <div style="margin: 24px 0; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border-light); padding-bottom: 24px;">
                                    <span style="font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--slate-muted); font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em;">Mulai Investasi</span>
                                    <div class="<%= pkg.isFeatured ? 'text-royal' : 'text-navy' %>" style="font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 900; line-height: 1.1; margin-top: 4px;">
                                        <%= pkg.price %>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                
                                <% 
                                    let featureList = [];
                                    if (pkg.features) {
                                        if (Array.isArray(pkg.features)) {
                                            featureList = pkg.features;
                                        } else if (typeof pkg.features === 'string') {
                                            featureList = pkg.features.split(',');
                                        }
                                    }
                                %>

                                <ul class="feature-check-list">
                                    <% featureList.forEach(feat => { %>
                                        <li class="feature-check-item">
                                            <span class="check-icon-circle">
                                                <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
                                            </span> 
                                            <span><%= typeof feat === 'string' ? feat.trim() : feat %></span>
                                        </li>
                                    <% }) %>
                                </ul>

                                <div style="margin-top: auto; padding-top: 24px;">
                                    <% if (pkg.isFeatured) { %>
                                        <a href="/contact?package=<%= encodeURIComponent(pkg.name) %>" class="btn-royal" style="width: 100%; text-align: center; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px;">
                                            Ambil Paket Ini
                                            <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="7" y1="17" x2="17" y2="7"></line><polyline points="7 7 17 7 17 17"></polyline></svg>
                                        </a>
                                    <% } else { %>
                                        <a href="/contact?package=<%= encodeURIComponent(pkg.name) %>" class="btn-ghost-navy" style="width: 100%; text-align: center; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px;">
                                            Ambil Paket Ini
                                            <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="7" y1="17" x2="17" y2="7"></line><polyline points="7 7 17 7 17 17"></polyline></svg>
                                        </a>
                                    <% } %>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        <% }) %>
                    <% } else { %>
                        <!-- Fallback Packages with 100% SVG Icons -->
                        <div class="pricing-card-kalana">
                            <h3 style="color: var(--navy-text); font-size: 1.35rem; margin-bottom: 8px;">Starter Landing Page</h3>
                            <p style="font-size: 0.925rem; color: var(--slate-body); min-height: 48px;">Solusi kilat validasi produk atau promosi fokus konversi tinggi tanpa ribet.</p>
                            <div style="margin: 24px 0; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border-light); padding-bottom: 24px;">
                                <span style="font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--slate-muted); font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em;">Mulai Investasi</span>
                                <div style="font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 900; color: var(--navy-text); line-height: 1.1; margin-top: 4px;">Rp 1.500.000</div>
                            </div>
                            <ul class="feature-check-list">
                                <li class="feature-check-item">
                                    <span class="check-icon-circle"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg></span>
                                    1 Halaman Responsif Mobile-First
                                </li>
                                <li class="feature-check-item">
                                    <span class="check-icon-circle"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg></span>
                                    Integrasi Direct Chat WhatsApp
                                </li>
                                <li class="feature-check-item">
                                    <span class="check-icon-circle"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg></span>
                                    Free Domain .my.id &amp; Cloudflare SSL
                                </li>
                                <li class="feature-check-item">
                                    <span class="check-icon-circle"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg></span>
                                    Selesai Cepat 3-5 Hari Kerja
                                </li>
                            </ul>
                            <div style="margin-top: auto; padding-top: 24px;">
                                <a href="/contact" class="btn-ghost-navy" style="width: 100%; text-align: center; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px;">
                                    Ambil Paket Ini
                                    <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="7" y1="17" x2="17" y2="7"></line><polyline points="7 7 17 7 17 17"></polyline></svg>
                                </a>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="pricing-card-kalana featured">
                            <div class="pricing-badge-popular">
                                <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l2.4 7.4h7.6l-6.2 4.5 2.4 7.4-6.2-4.6-6.2 4.6 2.4-7.4-6.2-4.5h7.6z"/></svg>
                                PILIHAN FAVORIT
                            </div>
                            <h3 style="color: var(--navy-text); font-size: 1.35rem; margin-bottom: 8px;">Company Profile Pro</h3>
                            <p style="font-size: 0.925rem; color: var(--slate-body); min-height: 48px;">Solusi komprehensif buat bangun otoritas brand perusahaan yang berkelas dan terpercaya.</p>
                            <div style="margin: 24px 0; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border-light); padding-bottom: 24px;">
                                <span style="font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--slate-muted); font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em;">Mulai Investasi</span>
                                <div style="font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 900; color: var(--royal-blue); line-height: 1.1; margin-top: 4px;">Rp 3.500.000</div>
                            </div>
                            <ul class="feature-check-list">
                                <li class="feature-check-item">
                                    <span class="check-icon-circle"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg></span>
                                    Hingga 7 Halaman Dinamis Premium
                                </li>
                                <li class="feature-check-item">
                                    <span class="check-icon-circle"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg></span>
                                    Panel Admin Mandiri Full Kontrol
                                </li>
                                <li class="feature-check-item">
                                    <span class="check-icon-circle"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg></span>
                                    Dynamic Schema SEO Google Ready
                                </li>
                                <li class="feature-check-item">
                                    <span class="check-icon-circle"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg></span>
                                    Garansi Maintenance &amp; Bug-Free 30 Hari
                                </li>
                            </ul>
                            <div style="margin-top: auto; padding-top: 24px;">
                                <a href="/contact" class="btn-royal" style="width: 100%; text-align: center; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px;">
                                    Ambil Paket Ini
                                    <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="7" y1="17" x2="17" y2="7"></line><polyline points="7 7 17 7 17 17"></polyline></svg>
                                </a>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="pricing-card-kalana">
                            <h3 style="color: var(--navy-text); font-size: 1.35rem; margin-bottom: 8px;">Custom Enterprise</h3>
                            <p style="font-size: 0.925rem; color: var(--slate-body); min-height: 48px;">Sistem web aplikasi khusus dengan integrasi database, multi-role, dan automation kompleks.</p>
                            <div style="margin: 24px 0; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border-light); padding-bottom: 24px;">
                                <span style="font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--slate-muted); font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em;">Mulai Investasi</span>
                                <div style="font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 900; color: var(--navy-text); line-height: 1.1; margin-top: 4px;">Rp 8.000.000+</div>
                            </div>
                            <ul class="feature-check-list">
                                <li class="feature-check-item">
                                    <span class="check-icon-circle"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg></span>
                                    Arsitektur Khusus Sesuai Alur Bisnis
                                </li>
                                <li class="feature-check-item">
                                    <span class="check-icon-circle"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg></span>
                                    Multi-Role User &amp; Granular Permissions
                                </li>
                                <li class="feature-check-item">
                                    <span class="check-icon-circle"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg></span>
                                    100% Hak Milik Source Code &amp; Dokumentasi
                                </li>
                                <li class="feature-check-item">
                                    <span class="check-icon-circle"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg></span>
                                    Dedicated Priority SLA &amp; Support
                                </li>
                            </ul>
                            <div style="margin-top: auto; padding-top: 24px;">
                                <a href="/contact" class="btn-ghost-navy" style="width: 100%; text-align: center; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px;">
                                    Konsultasi Khusus
                                    <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="7" y1="17" x2="17" y2="7"></line><polyline points="7 7 17 7 17 17"></polyline></svg>
                                </a>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    <% } %>
                </div>

                <!-- Custom Request Banner -->
                <div class="tactile-card tactile-card-heavy" style="margin-top: 80px; padding: 50px 40px; text-align: center; background: #ffffff;">
                    <div style="width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--offwhite-card); display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 20px; color: var(--royal-blue); border: 1px solid var(--border-light);">
                        <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z"></path><polyline points="3.27 6.96 12 12.01 20.73 6.96"></polyline><line x1="12" y1="22.08" x2="12" y2="12"></line></svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3 style="font-size: 1.8rem; color: var(--navy-text); margin-bottom: 12px;">Punya Kebutuhan Spesifik atau Sistem Khusus?</h3>
                    <p style="max-width: 620px; margin: 0 auto 28px; color: var(--slate-body); font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.7;">
                        Tiap brand punya problem unik. Kasih tau kami visi produk dan target bisnismu, tim kami siap bikinin penawaran custom yang presisi dan efisien.
                    </p>
                    <a href="/contact" class="btn-royal" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
                        Diskusikan Kebutuhan Custom
                        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>

</body>
</html>
